Package: teslatlas-edge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, libc6, systemd (>= 254)
Maintainer: Magrathean UK LTD <contact@magrathean.uk>
Description: User-operated Tesla Fleet Telemetry ingress for Teslatlas Hub
 Teslatlas Edge receives decoded Fleet Telemetry records, stores them in an
 encrypted bounded spool, and exposes durable batches to a home Hub.
